WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.435 --> 00:00:03.551
Lesson seven. Space and Sky!

2
00:00:04.647 --> 00:00:11.814
Hello, hello! Hello, hello! Wave your hand, and say hello! Hello!

3
00:00:12.614 --> 00:00:14.272
Coco, what do we learn today?

4
00:00:14.322 --> 00:00:17.945
Today we learn: Space and Sky! Let's go!

5
00:00:19.728 --> 00:00:23.345
Moon! Say it with me. Moon!

6
00:00:27.287 --> 00:00:30.603
Sun! Say it with me. Sun!

7
00:00:34.587 --> 00:00:38.037
Star! Say it with me. Star!

8
00:00:42.301 --> 00:00:45.818
Planet! Say it with me. Planet!

9
00:00:49.606 --> 00:00:53.273
Rocket! Say it with me. Rocket!

10
00:00:57.297 --> 00:01:01.263
Astronaut! Say it with me. Astronaut!

11
00:01:05.211 --> 00:01:08.744
Cloud! Say it with me. Cloud!

12
00:01:12.783 --> 00:01:16.599
Rainbow! Say it with me. Rainbow!

13
00:01:20.623 --> 00:01:25.767
Listen. The sun shines in the sky.

14
00:01:25.817 --> 00:01:29.388
Say it with me. The sun shines in the sky.

15
00:01:34.268 --> 00:01:40.473
The bright sun shines warmly during the daytime. An astronaut travels to space in a rocket.

16
00:01:40.523 --> 00:01:41.873
I like this story!

17
00:01:42.671 --> 00:01:47.899
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:47.949 --> 00:01:49.099
Star!

19
00:01:50.092 --> 00:01:55.303
Look! What's the word?

20
00:01:55.353 --> 00:01:56.503
Astronaut!

21
00:01:57.517 --> 00:02:02.858
Value corner: Gratitude. Saying thank you for what we have makes us feel happy.

22
00:02:02.908 --> 00:02:04.624
I can show gratitude too!

23
00:02:05.696 --> 00:02:13.166
Bye-bye, bye-bye! See you soon! Wave your hand. Bye-bye, bye-bye!

24
00:02:13.216 --> 00:02:14.900
Bye-bye, friends!

